OL,3,GNEWSAJury dismissed in Elbit raid trial
OL,4,
OL,5,FA trial of five people accused of
OL,6,Fraiding a UK site of an Israel-based
OL,7,Fdefence firm has stopped after the jury
OL,8,Fwas dismissed.
OL,10,FQesser Zuhrah, 21, Zahra Farooque, 26,
OL,11,FKamran Ahmed, 29, Heba Muraisi, 31 -
OL,12,Fall from London - and Liam Mullany, 34,
OL,13,Ffrom Poole, were on trial for their
OL,14,Falleged role in a break-in at the Elbit
OL,15,FSystems UK Ltd factory on the outskirts
OL,16,Fof Bristol in August 2024. They denied
OL,17,Fcharges of criminal damage and violent
OL,18,Fdisorder.
OL,20,FJudge Lees discharged the jury on
OL,21,FWednesday - a month after the trial
OL,22,Fopened at Woolwich Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
